  "$id": "/entity/tradetier.form.json",
  "title": "Entity TradeTier",
  "description": "Defines a tier of trades that unlock as the trading entity gains experience. Villagers start at tier 1 (novice) and unlock higher tiers through player trades, offering progressively better items. Each tier contains trade groups that determine available offers at that merchant level.",
